### 1. POST: crear un servicio completo (esperá 201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/services
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Barba",
  "description": "Perfilado y recorte de barba",
  "duration": 20,
  "price": 5000,
  "category": "Peluquería",
  "available": true
}

### 2. POST: body incompleto (esperá 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/services
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Solo nombre"
}

### 3. POST: mandando un id a propósito
POST http://localhost:8080/api/services
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 999,
  "name": "Prueba de id",
  "description": "Servicio para probar el id",
  "duration": 10,
  "price": 1000,
  "category": "Prueba",
  "available": true
}

### 4. PUT: cambiar el precio (cambiá el 5 por el id que te haya tocado)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/services/5
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 6000
}

### 5. PUT: intentando cambiar el id
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/services/5
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 999,
  "price": 7000
}

### 6. PUT: servicio inexistente (esperá 404)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/services/99
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 1
}

### 7. DELETE: eliminar un servicio (cambiá el id según corresponda)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/services/5

### 8. DELETE: servicio inexistente (esperá 404)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/services/99

### 9. GET: ver cómo quedó la lista
GET http://localhost:8080/api/services



### Reserva: crear una reserva completa (esperá 201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientName": "Ana Pérez",
  "clientEmail": "ana@mail.com",
  "date": "2026-11-20",
  "time": "15:30"
}

### Reserva: incompleta (esperá 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientName": "Solo nombre"
}

### Reserva: mandando id y services a propósito
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 999,
  "clientName": "Luis Gómez",
  "clientEmail": "luis@mail.com",
  "date": "2026-11-21",
  "time": "10:00",
  "status": "confirmed",
  "services": [{ "service": 1, "quantity": 5 }]
}

### Reserva: buscar por id (esperá 200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/1

### Reserva: id inexistente (esperá 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/99



### Agregar servicio 1 a la reserva 1 (esperá 200)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/1/services/1

### Agregar el MISMO servicio de nuevo
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/1/services/1

### Agregar otro servicio distinto
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/1/services/3

### Servicio inexistente (esperá 404)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/1/services/99

### Reserva inexistente (esperá 404)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/99/services/1

### Ver cómo quedó la reserva
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/1